cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "Umi-Time Specification"
abstract: >
  The Umi-Time Specification defines a uniform presentation of UTC as a 360-unit
  cycle. Umi-Time gives us one shared number for the exact same instant globally,
  while presenting it in a way that is locally meaningful across visual, textual,
  and digital interfaces.
authors:
